{"title":"Crafting","sourceTitle":"Crafting/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Crafting\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Crafting (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Crafting/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Crafteo (1% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Crafting/it\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Creazione (1% translated)\" lang=\"it\" dir=\"ltr\">italiano</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Crafting/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Создание (3% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Crafting é uma mecânica de jogo que permite ao jogador criar novos itens a partir de uma combinação específica de itens existentes. Uma das coisas mais exclusivas de Vintage Story é o número de diferentes métodos de elaboração disponíveis para o jogador. Esta página é um resumo de todos os métodos de elaboração atualmente disponíveis no VS, com links para informações mais detalhadas abaixo.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>This page will guide you through the 5 main crafting methods you need to survive, starting from your very first day.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td><b>Dica:</b>\n<pre></pre>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Grade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Grade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Lascando\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Lascando</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Moldando_argila\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Moldando argila</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#The_pit_kiln_(baking_the_clay)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The pit kiln (baking the clay)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Fundição\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Fundição</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Forjando\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Forjando</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Grid&#95;crafting\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grade\">Grade</span></h2>\n<p>A elaboração baseada em grau está disponível no início do jogo. Os jogadores acessam a grau de artesanato pressionando a tecla ‘E’ (padrão), que aparece no lado direito da tela. Para usar, os jogadores colocam itens da barra quente ou do inventário em padrões específicos dentro da grau 3 X 3. Durante o jogo, receitas de criação de grau são fornecidas no manual, acessado usando H (padrão). A elaboração de grau é frequentemente combinada com outras mecânicas de elaboração, por exemplo: a maioria dos cabeçotes de ferramentas (estalados, fundidos ou forjados) devem ser colocados na grau de elaboração com um bastão (alça) para completar a ferramenta.\n</p>\n</div>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frame\"><a href=\"/File:GridCraftingLQ.gif\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/9/9c/GridCraftingLQ.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"640\" data-file-height=\"360\" /></a><figcaption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Right-click and drag to quickly spread items in the grid.</span></figcaption></figure>\n<p><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Grid crafting is the simplest way to make items, and you can do it from the very start.</span>\n</p><p><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">To use the crafting grid:</span>\n</p>\n<ol><li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Press the <style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r116235\">.mw-parser-output .keyboard-key{border:1px solid #aaa;border-radius:0.2em;box-shadow:0.1em 0.1em 0.2em rgba(0,0,0,0.1);background-color:#f9f9f9;background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,#eee,#f9f9f9,#eee);color:#000;padding:0.1em 0.3em;font-family:inherit;font-size:0.85em}.mw-parser-output .nowrap{white-space:nowrap}</style><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">E</kbd> to open your inventory.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Look for the 3x3 grid of empty squares on the right side of the screen.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Drag items from your inventory into this grid in the correct shape.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Take your finished item from the output box on the right.</span></li></ol>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>If you do not know the shape to use, press <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">H</kbd> to check the handbook! Grid crafting is often the final step for making tools. For example, once you make a stone <a href=\"/Tools/pt-br\" title=\"Tools/pt-br\">tool</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tools/pt-br\" title=\"Tools/pt-br\"> </a></span> head, you put it in the grid with a <a href=\"/Stick/pt-br\" title=\"Stick/pt-br\">stick</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Stick/pt-br\" title=\"Stick/pt-br\"> </a></span> to make a finished tool.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td><b>Dica:</b>\n<pre></pre>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><span id=\"Knapping&#95;(stone&#95;tools)\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Lascando\">Lascando</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/Knapping\" title=\"Knapping\">Lascando</a> é um método de artesanato que permite aos jogadores fazer ferramentas primitivas de \"pedra\" removendo pequenos pedaços de pedra para moldar uma lâmina ou cabeça de ferramenta.\n</p>\n</div>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frame\"><a href=\"/File:KnappingFlint.gif\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/d/d0/KnappingFlint.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"640\" data-file-height=\"360\" /></a><figcaption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Left-click to break the orange squares away.</span></figcaption></figure>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p><a href=\"/Knapping/pt-br\" title=\"Knapping/pt-br\">Lascando</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Knapping/pt-br\" title=\"Knapping/pt-br\"> </a></span> is how you make your very first tools out of <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/stone\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/stone\">stone</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Stone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stone\"> </a></span>. You will chip away small pieces of a rock to make a sharp tool head (like an axe or knife).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p><b>What you need:</b>\n</p>\n</div> \n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<ul><li>Two pieces of <a href=\"/Flint/pt-br\" title=\"Flint/pt-br\">flint</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Flint/pt-br\" title=\"Flint/pt-br\"> </a></span>, or two loose stones of the same type (like <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/granite\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/granite\">granite</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Granite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Granite\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/basalt\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/basalt\">basalt</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Basalt\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Basalt\"> </a></span>, or <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/obsidian\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/obsidian\">obsidian</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Obsidian\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Obsidian\"> </a></span>).</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p><b>How to do it:</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ol><li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Put one piece of stone in your active hand.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Aim at the solid ground, hold <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">shift</kbd> and click <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span>.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">A menu will pop up. Click on the tool you want to make (for example, an <a href=\"/Axe/pt-br\" title=\"Axe/pt-br\">axe head</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Axe/pt-br\" title=\"Axe/pt-br\"> </a></span>).</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">The stone will appear on the ground, covered in little orange squares (voxels).</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Aim at the orange squares with your second stone and click <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Left mouse button\" src=\"/images/0/0a/LMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span> to break them away.</span></li>\n<li><div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\"></div></li></ol>\n<p>Once all the orange squares are gone, the tool head will pop into your inventory!\n</p>\n\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>You can then open your inventory (<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">E</kbd>) and combine this tool head with a stick in the crafting grid to finish your tool.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Clay&#95;forming&#95;(pottery&#95;&amp;&#95;molds)\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Moldando_argila\">Moldando argila</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/Clay_forming\" title=\"Clay forming\">Moldando argila</a> é um método de artesanato que permite ao jogador colocar e remover voxels de argila para formar um recipiente moldado.\n</p>\n</div>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frame\"><a href=\"/File:ClayFormingLQ.gif\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/4/4a/ClayFormingLQ.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"640\" data-file-height=\"360\" /></a><figcaption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Press <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F</kbd> to open the tool menu. The <code>Duplicate Layer</code> tool is a life saver!</span></figcaption></figure>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p><a href=\"/Clay_forming/pt-br\" title=\"Clay forming/pt-br\">Moldando argila</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Clay_forming/pt-br\" title=\"Clay forming/pt-br\"> </a></span> is how you make <a href=\"/Bowl/pt-br\" title=\"Bowl/pt-br\">bowls</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bowl/pt-br\" title=\"Bowl/pt-br\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Cooking_pot/pt-br\" title=\"Cooking pot/pt-br\">cooking pots</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cooking_pot/pt-br\" title=\"Cooking pot/pt-br\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Storage_vessel/pt-br\" title=\"Storage vessel/pt-br\">storage vessels</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Storage_vessel/pt-br\" title=\"Storage vessel/pt-br\"> </a></span>, and <a href=\"/Mold/pt-br\" title=\"Mold/pt-br\">molds</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mold/pt-br\" title=\"Mold/pt-br\"> </a></span> for <a href=\"/Metal/pt-br\" title=\"Metal/pt-br\">metal</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Metal/pt-br\" title=\"Metal/pt-br\"> </a></span>. Instead of breaking pieces away, you will be building an item up layer by layer.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p><b>What you need:</b>\n</p>\n</div> \n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<ul><li>Blue <a href=\"/Clay/pt-br\" title=\"Clay/pt-br\">clay</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Clay/pt-br\" title=\"Clay/pt-br\"> </a></span>, red clay, or fire clay. (You can find clay near water or in dirt areas with high rainfall).</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p><b>How to do it:</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ol><li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Hold the clay in your active hand.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Aim at the solid ground, hold <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">shift</kbd> and click <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span>.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Select the item you want to make from the menu.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">The base of the item will appear on the ground.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Hold <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span> to add clay to the green squares. If you make a mistake, hold <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Left mouse button\" src=\"/images/0/0a/LMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span> to remove clay from the orange squares.</span></li></ol>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td><b>Dica:</b>\n<pre></pre>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h3><span id=\"The_pit_kiln_.28baking_the_clay.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_pit_kiln_(baking_the_clay)\">The pit kiln (baking the clay)</span></h3>\n</div> \n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frame\"><a href=\"/File:PitKiln.gif\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/8/8f/PitKiln.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"640\" data-file-height=\"360\" /></a><figcaption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">A fully loaded pit kiln before it is lit.</span></figcaption></figure>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>When you finish shaping a clay item, it is \"Raw\". It cannot be used yet! You must bake it in a <a href=\"/Pit_kiln/pt-br\" title=\"Pit kiln/pt-br\">pit kiln</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pit_kiln/pt-br\" title=\"Pit kiln/pt-br\"> </a></span> to make it hard.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p><b>How to fire clay:</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ol><li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Dig a hole in the ground that is exactly 1 block deep. (Make sure there is no tall grass or wood nearby, or it will catch on fire!)</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Hold your <i>raw</i> clay item, aim inside the hole, hold <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">shift</kbd> and click <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span> to place it. You can fit up to 4 small items, or 1 large item (like a storage vessel) in a single hole.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Next, aim at the hole and add exactly 10 <a href=\"/Dry_grass/pt-br\" title=\"Dry grass/pt-br\">dry grass</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Dry_grass/pt-br\" title=\"Dry grass/pt-br\"> </a></span> using <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">shift</kbd> + <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span>.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Then, add 8 <a href=\"/Stick/pt-br\" title=\"Stick/pt-br\">sticks</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Stick/pt-br\" title=\"Stick/pt-br\"> </a></span> (<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">shift</kbd> + <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span>).</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Finally, add 4 to 8 <a href=\"/Firewood/pt-br\" title=\"Firewood/pt-br\">firewood</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Firewood/pt-br\" title=\"Firewood/pt-br\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Peat/pt-br\" title=\"Peat/pt-br\">peat</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Peat/pt-br\" title=\"Peat/pt-br\"> </a></span>, or <a href=\"/Coal/pt-br\" title=\"Coal/pt-br\">coal</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Coal/pt-br\" title=\"Coal/pt-br\"> </a></span> (<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">shift</kbd> + <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span>).</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Light the top of the pile with a <a href=\"/Torch/pt-br\" title=\"Torch/pt-br\">torch</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Torch/pt-br\" title=\"Torch/pt-br\"> </a></span> or a <a href=\"/Firestarter/pt-br\" title=\"Firestarter/pt-br\">firestarter</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Firestarter/pt-br\" title=\"Firestarter/pt-br\"> </a></span>.</span></li></ol>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>Wait about a day (usually 10 to 20 in-game hours). When the fire goes out, your item will be dark brown and have \"Fired\" in its name. It is now ready to use!\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Casting&#95;(Your&#95;First&#95;Metal)\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h2><span id=\"Fundi.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fundição\">Fundição</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/Casting\" title=\"Casting\">Fundição</a> é usado para fazer as primeiras ferramentas de metal de cobre e bronze, que são fundidas e \"fundidas\" em cabeçotes de ferramentas usando moldes.\n</p>\n</div>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frame\"><a href=\"/File:PouringMetal.gif\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/f/f8/PouringMetal.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"640\" data-file-height=\"360\" /></a><figcaption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Pouring glowing hot liquid metal into a fired mold.</span></figcaption></figure>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p><a href=\"/Casting/pt-br\" title=\"Casting/pt-br\">Fundição</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Casting/pt-br\" title=\"Casting/pt-br\"> </a></span> is how you enter the Copper Age. You will melt metal nuggets down into a liquid and pour them into clay molds.\n</p>\n</div> \n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p><b>What you need:</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">A fired <a href=\"/Crucible/pt-br\" title=\"Crucible/pt-br\">crucible</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Crucible/pt-br\" title=\"Crucible/pt-br\"> </a></span> (made from clay).</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Fired tool <a href=\"/Mold/pt-br\" title=\"Mold/pt-br\">molds</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mold/pt-br\" title=\"Mold/pt-br\"> </a></span> or ingot molds (made from clay).</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">A pair of tongs.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">A <a href=\"/Firepit/pt-br\" title=\"Firepit/pt-br\">firepit</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Firepit/pt-br\" title=\"Firepit/pt-br\"> </a></span> and fuel (peat bricks, coal, or charcoal. Firewood does not burn hot enough to melt copper!).</span></li>\n<li><div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\"></div></li></ul>\n<p>Metal <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/nugget\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/nugget\">nuggets</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Nugget\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nugget\"> </a></span> (like copper).\n</p>\n\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p><b>How to do it:</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ol><li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Put your crucible into the cooking slot of a firepit.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Add your metal nuggets into the crucible (each mold usually takes 20 nuggets, which equals 100 units of liquid metal).</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Add your hot fuel and light the fire.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Wait until the metal reaches its melting point and turns into a glowing liquid.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Put tongs in your offhand.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Take the glowing crucible out of the fire and put it in your active hand.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Aim at your empty, fired clay molds on the ground. Hold <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">shift</kbd> and <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span> to pour the liquid metal inside.</span></li>\n<li><div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\"></div></li></ol>\n<p>Wait for the metal to cool down, then break the mold to get your new solid metal tool head or ingot!\n</p>\n\n<p><span id=\"Smithing&#95;(advanced&#95;metalworking)\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Forjando\">Forjando</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/Smithing\" title=\"Smithing\">Forjando</a> permite aos jogadores moldar <a href=\"/Metal\" title=\"Metal\">metal</a> lingotes em cabeças de armas, cabeças de ferramentas e placas usadas para criar lanternas e peças de armadura.\n</p>\n</div>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frame\"><a href=\"/File:Smithing.gif\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/2/2b/Smithing.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"640\" data-file-height=\"360\" /></a><figcaption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Hit the hot metal to push it into the empty blue and green squares.</span></figcaption></figure>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p><a href=\"/Smithing/pt-br\" title=\"Smithing/pt-br\">Forja</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Smithing/pt-br\" title=\"Smithing/pt-br\"> </a></span> is the most advanced way to make <a href=\"/Tools/pt-br\" title=\"Tools/pt-br\">tools</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tools/pt-br\" title=\"Tools/pt-br\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Weapons/pt-br\" title=\"Weapons/pt-br\">weapons</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Weapons/pt-br\" title=\"Weapons/pt-br\"> </a></span>, and <a href=\"/Armor/pt-br\" title=\"Armor/pt-br\">armor</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Armor/pt-br\" title=\"Armor/pt-br\"> </a></span>. Instead of pouring liquid metal, you will be hammering a solid, hot metal ingot into shape!\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p><b>What you need:</b>\n</p>\n</div> \n<ul><li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">An <a href=\"/Anvil/pt-br\" title=\"Anvil/pt-br\">anvil</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Anvil/pt-br\" title=\"Anvil/pt-br\"> </a></span> (copper, bronze, or iron).</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">A <a href=\"/Hammer/pt-br\" title=\"Hammer/pt-br\">hammer</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Hammer/pt-br\" title=\"Hammer/pt-br\"> </a></span>.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">A pair of <a href=\"/Tongs/pt-br\" title=\"Tongs/pt-br\">tongs</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tongs/pt-br\" title=\"Tongs/pt-br\"> </a></span>.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">A <a href=\"/Forge/pt-br\" title=\"Forge/pt-br\">forge</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Forge/pt-br\" title=\"Forge/pt-br\"> </a></span> filled with coal or charcoal.</span></li>\n<li><div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\"></div></li></ul>\n<p>Metal <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ingots\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ingots\">ingots</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ingots\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ingots\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p><b>How to do it:</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ol><li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Put your metal ingot into the forge, add fuel, and light it.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Wait until the ingot is glowing bright hot.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Grab the hot ingot using your tongs.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Aim at the top of your anvil, hold <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">shift</kbd> and <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span> to place the hot ingot down.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">A menu will open asking what you want to forge. Pick your item.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Put your hammer in your active hand.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Left mouse button\" src=\"/images/0/0a/LMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span> <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">on the hot metal to flatten and push it. Your goal is to move the metal out of the \"orange\" squares and into the empty \"green\" or \"blue\" squares.</span></li>\n<li><div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\"></div></li></ol>\n<p>Press <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F</kbd> to change how your hammer strikes. Some modes spread the metal flat, while others push the metal left, right, up, or down.\n</p>\n\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>If your metal turns dark and stops moving, it has cooled down! You must use your tongs to pick it back up, put it back in the forge, and heat it up again. If you run out of metal before the shape is finished, simply heat up a second ingot and place it right on top of the first one to add more material.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Navegação Wiki</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>História antiga</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\">Guias</a><span style=\"display:none\">[[::Category:Guides| ]]</span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\">Perguntas frequentes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Vintage_Story_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Vintage Story Original Soundtrack\">Trilha sonora</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Vintage_Story_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Vintage Story Original Soundtrack\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Version_history\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Version history\">Versões</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Version_history\" title=\"Version history\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Controls\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Controls\">Controles</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Controls\" title=\"Controls\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Sistemas de jogo</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #CCBCAB;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Crafting\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Crafting\">Fabricação</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Crafting\" title=\"Crafting\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Knapping\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Knapping\">Lascando</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Knapping\" title=\"Knapping\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Clay_forming\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Clay forming\">Moldando argila</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Clay_forming\" title=\"Clay forming\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Smithing\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Smithing\">Forjando</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Smithing\" title=\"Smithing\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cooking\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cooking\">Cozimento</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">Temperatura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Hunger\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Hunger\">Fome</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Hunger\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hunger\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Mining\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Mining\">Mineração</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mining\" title=\"Mining\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temporal_stability\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temporal stability\">Estabilidade temporal</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temporal_stability\" title=\"Temporal stability\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Mechanical_power\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Mechanical power\">Potência mecânica</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mechanical_power\" title=\"Mechanical power\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trading\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trading\">Comércio</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">Agricultura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Animal_husbandry\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Animal husbandry\">Criação de animais</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Animal_husbandry\" title=\"Animal husbandry\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Mundo</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/World_Generation\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/World Generation\">Geração de mundo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/World_Generation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"World Generation\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Biomes\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Biomes\">Biomas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Biomes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Biomes\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Weather\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Weather\">Clima</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Weather\" title=\"Weather\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temporal_stability#Temporal_storms\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temporal stability\">Tempestades temporais</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temporal_stability#Temporal_storms\" title=\"Temporal stability\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Itens</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #CCBCAB;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tools\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tools\">Ferramentas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tools\" title=\"Tools\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:M